roject (MRP)\n\nMy addon Create Actor is a full Godot project which you can use as a reproduction. Right-click on a file/folder and select 'Create Actor...'. This spawns this dialogue. \n\nhttps://github.com/SirLich/godot-create-actor","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106127/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106127/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}